    "custom_liquid_zLBj8J": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  Sofneu Tights — Fit Tips\n  Shopify: paste this complete block into a Custom liquid section.\n  Desktop: four cards in one row. Mobile: two columns by two rows.\n  No JavaScript required.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<style>\n  .sofneu-fit-tips,\n  .sofneu-fit-tips * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips {\n    --sft-ink: #2b2b2b;\n    --sft-muted: #7e756e;\n    --sft-accent: #8b7355;\n    --sft-line: #e9e1da;\n    --sft-soft: #f6f1ec;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 24px 20px;\n    color: var(--sft-ink);\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-title {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    color: var(--sft-ink);\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card {\n    min-width: 0;\n    padding: 16px 14px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--sft-line);\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: var(--sft-soft);\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-icon {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    flex: 0 0 24px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--sft-accent);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card h3 {\n    margin: 2px 0 0;\n    color: var(--sft-ink);\n    font: inherit;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card p {\n    margin: 9px 0 0;\n    color: var(--sft-muted);\n    font: inherit;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-note {\n    margin: 12px 0 0;\n    padding: 11px 13px;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--sft-accent);\n    background: var(--sft-soft);\n    color: var(--sft-muted);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-note strong {\n    color: var(--sft-ink);\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sofneu-fit-tips {\n      padding: 22px 14px;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-title {\n      margin-bottom: 13px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card {\n      padding: 12px 10px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card-head {\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-icon {\n      width: 22px;\n      height: 22px;\n      margin-bottom: 7px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card h3 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-card p {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .sofneu-fit-tips .sft-note {\n      margin-top: 10px;\n      padding: 10px 11px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"sofneu-fit-tips\" aria-labelledby=\"sofneu-fit-tips-title\">\n  <h2 id=\"sofneu-fit-tips-title\" class=\"sft-title h2\">Fit Tips</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"sft-grid\">\n    <article class=\"sft-card\">\n      <div class=\"sft-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"sft-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↕</span>\n        <h3>Taller or longer legs</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p>If you are between sizes, choose the larger size for additional leg length and comfort.</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"sft-card\">\n      <div class=\"sft-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"sft-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>\n        <h3>Petite or shorter legs</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p>Use your waist and hip measurements first. Do not size down based on height alone.</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"sft-card\">\n      <div class=\"sft-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"sft-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">＋</span>\n        <h3>Fuller hips or thighs</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p>Follow the largest relevant measurement. If it reaches the next range, choose the larger size.</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"sft-card\">\n      <div class=\"sft-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"sft-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span>\n        <h3>Slim waist with longer legs</h3>\n      </div>\n      <p>Prioritise leg length while keeping your waist within the recommended size range.</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"sft-note\"><strong>Measurements point to different sizes?</strong> Choose the larger size for more length and comfort.</p>\n</section>"
      }
